~ start
Erm. Is this your first time playing?
- Yes
	=> questions
- No
	if Main.global_state == "Act 0"
		Erm. It literally is. I'm checking the global state right now.
		So do you need my assistance?
		- Yes
			=> questions
		- No 
			It's always ok to ask for help.
	else:
		Oki, just making sure.
=> END

~ questions
How may I assist you?	
- Where are we?
	We are in [b] The DevRooms.
	=> questions
- What should I do?
	As my late friend Charlie would say, "Frolic around and find out".
	Check things that catch your eye. You never know what collection of pixels can lead you to the correct path.
	=> questions
- Something is wrong...
	Of course something is wrong. You're in a dream, silly!
- Nevermind, no questions. Don't assist me.
	You've made me waste precious lip moisture for this.